                <mxCell id="BLn4kZ0Jki_Ed7WSkoAJ-28" value="This unit can be anything, like can, bottle (small), bottle (large), head, box, packet, or perhaps &quot;each&quot; in the case where the item does not have a unit (like a burger)&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It&#39;s done like this so that we can have, for example, 1 small bottle of tea (500mL) vs half of a large bottle of tea (half of 2L)&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
