                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="BLn4kZ0Jki_Ed7WSkoAJ-40" value="&lt;b&gt;These nutritional information are assumed to be in the following units:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Energy: kilocalories&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Protein, Fat (all types), Carbohydrates, Sugars, Dietary Fibre: grams&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Sodium, Cholesterol, Vitamin B1 (Thiamin), Vitamin B2 (Riboflavin), Vitamin B3 (Niacin), Vitamin B5 (Pantothenic Acid), Vitamin B6, Vitamin C, Vitamin E, Calcium, Chlorides, Iron, Magnesium, Manganese, Phosphorus, Potassium, Zinc, Caffeine, Tea Polyphenols: milligrams&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Vitamin A, Vitamin B7 (Biotin), Folate and Folic Acid (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Vitamin B9), Vitamin B12,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Vitamin D, Vitamin K, Chromium, Copper, Iodine, Molybdenum, Selenium: micrograms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=11;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
